Although I previously patched AWC Forum to work with the latest version of 
MediaWiki it still has drawbacks:
1. It has no localisation support from translatewiki.net
2. Not an important bug: it stops us from using pretty urls in the wiki (a 
not researched bug). As most of us use mailing lists I suggest disabling 
AWC forum (copying it's content probably to the wiki itself). There is also 
another less sexy extension: 
http://mw.lojban.org/index.php?title=Special:WikiForum

pei ?

